    "body": "I also have considered using \"_ZGVr\", but it will lack LMUL information and so just support a single fixed LMUL value. `_ZGV_xxx(vfloat64m4_t) `and `__ZGV_xxx(vfloat64m2_t)` have different computing power. I think if we want to take full advantage of RVV computing power, and need to attach LMUL information into vector function name.",
