    "body": "The reason I chose \"_ZGV\" in the first place is that GCC take a single character as isa name in simd_clone_mangle (vecsize_mangle in struct cgraph_simd_clone), so I delete \"r\" from \"r1/2/4/8\" to meet gcc requirements. ",
